  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Plain Waffles.png|left|184x184px|Plain Waffles]]\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 114\n |price = 1 to 198\n |time = 25 min\n |source = {{Infoicon|wafflem|bigger|link=Waffle Maker}}\n |xp = 24\n |base = 55\n |dia = 3\n |time3 = 21 min\n}}\n'''Plain Waffles''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 114. It was added in Spring 2023 update.\n\nIt is used to make [[Berry Waffles|berry waffles]], [[Chocolate Waffles|chocolate waffles]] and [[Breakfast Waffles|breakfast waffles]].\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making Plain Waffles'''===\n[[File:Waffle Maker.png|150px|left|Waffle Maker]]\nPlain Waffle are made in the [[Waffle Maker]].\n\nTo make plain waffles, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:White Sugar.png|75px|White Sugar|link=White Sugar]]\n|[[File:Egg.png|75px|Egg|link=Egg]]\n|[[File:Wheat.png|75px|Wheat|link=Wheat]]\n|-\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x5'''\n|}\nIt takes 25 Minutes to make plain waffles, and 21 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] machine. Each unit gives players 24 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling plain waffles'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Plain waffles can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 1,980 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 units.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a plain waffles costs 169 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Using plain waffles'''===\nPlain waffles are used to make the following [[products]]:\n\n{{Item Usage|Plain Waffles\n|Berry Waffles|1|114\n|Chocolate Waffles|1|117\n|Blueberry Waffles|1|118\n|Breakfast Waffles|1|119\n}}\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders require 1 to 2 plain waffles per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n*Producing each of the other products in the waffle maker requires a plain waffles, it is best to make enough plain waffles to make other waffles.\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Einfache Waffeln\n|es = Gofres normales\n|it = Waffle classici\n|nl = Klassieke Wafels\n|no = Vanlige vafler\n|ru = Простые вафли\n}}\n[[pt-br:Waffles simples]]\n\n[[Category:Waffle Maker Products]]\n[[Category:Egg Products]]\n[[Category:Wheat Products]]\n[[Category:White Sugar Products]]",
